<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">BATTLES / MAKE IT COUNT</div><h1>Pick your battles.</h1><p>Training, equipment, stamina and education shape every fight. Speed decides who strikes first.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/equipment">Manage equipment →</a></div>
<div id="fightResult" class="game-feedback" role="status" hidden></div>
<section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Your fight plan</h2><span class="small-badge">5 ENERGY · 10% STAMINA</span></div><div class="fight-plan"><div><label for="fightStance">Combat stance</label><select id="fightStance"><option value="balanced">Balanced — standard attack and defense</option><option value="aggressive">Aggressive — +20% attack, −20% defense</option><option value="defensive">Defensive — −15% attack, +25% defense</option></select></div><div><label for="fightEnding">On victory</label><select id="fightEnding"><option value="mug">Mug — steal 8% of cash on hand, less XP</option><option value="leave">Leave — 50% more XP and more respect</option><option value="hospitalize">Hospitalize — keep rival out for 10 minutes</option></select></div></div><p class="panel-intro">Speed contests your opponent’s dexterity to hit; strength deals damage and defense reduces it. Misses are shown in the battle log. Mug and leave put the loser in recovery for 90 and 60 seconds. A failed attack means 3 minutes in the hospital. Surviving fighters keep their remaining HP. A 20-round stalemate gives no winner or rewards. Same city only; a 10-minute cooldown applies per target.</p><p id="fightReadiness" class="subtle"><%= user.in_hospital || user.in_jail ? 'Recover before attacking.' : `Ready: ${user.energy} energy · ${user.stamina}% stamina · ${user.hp} / ${user.max_hp} HP` %></p></section>
<section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Citizens at <%= PRISONS.find(p=>p.id===user.prison_id)?.short || 'your city' %></h2><a class="text-link" href="/gym">Prepare at the gym →</a></div><p class="panel-intro">Listed stats are base stats. Equipped gear and property bonuses can make an opponent stronger than they look.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Citizen</th><th>Level</th><th>STR</th><th>DEF</th><th>SPD</th><th>DEX</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% targets.forEach(t=>{ const hospital=t.in_hospital && t.hospital_until>now; const jailed=t.in_jail && t.jail_until>now; const cd=Math.max(0,600-(now-(cdMap[t.id]||0))); %>
<tr><td><a href="/profile/<%= encodeURIComponent(t.username) %>"><%= t.username %></a></td><td><%= t.level %></td><td><%= t.strength %></td><td><%= t.defense %></td><td><%= t.speed %></td><td><%= t.dexterity %></td><td><button class="action-button fight-button" data-target="<%= t.id %>" data-ready="<%= cd ? cdMap[t.id]+600 : 0 %>" data-recovering="<%= hospital || jailed ? 'true' : '' %>" <%= hospital || jailed || cd || user.in_jail || user.in_hospital || user.energy<5 || user.stamina<10 ? 'disabled' : '' %>><%= hospital ? 'Hospital' : jailed ? 'Jail' : cd ? `Wait ${Math.ceil(cd/60)}m` : 'Attack ↗' %></button></td></tr>
<% }); %>
<% if(!targets.length) { %><tr><td colspan="6"><div class="empty-state">No other citizens here yet. Invite someone to your game and prepare your stats in the gym.</div></td></tr><% } %>
</tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="fightLog" class="dashboard-panel" hidden><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Battle report</h2><span id="logResult" class="small-badge"></span></div><div id="logLines" class="battle-log"></div></section>
<% if(history.length) { %><section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Recent battles</h2></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Opponent</th><th>Result</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Cash moved</th><th>When</th></tr></thead><tbody><% history.forEach(h=>{ const iAtt=h.attacker_id===user.id; const draw=h.result==='draw'; const won=iAtt ? !!h.attacker_won : !h.attacker_won; %><tr><td><%= h.opp_name %></td><td><%= draw ? 'DRAW' : won ? 'WIN' : 'LOSS' %></td><td><%= h.ending || 'mug' %></td><td><%= h.cash_stolen ? (iAtt ? '+' : '−')+'$'+h.cash_stolen.toLocaleString() : '—' %></td><td><%= timeAgo(h.created_at) %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div></section><% } %>
<script type="application/json" id="battleState"><%- JSON.stringify({ user:{ energy:user.energy,stamina:user.stamina,hp:user.hp,max_hp:user.max_hp,in_jail:user.in_jail,in_hospital:user.in_hospital } }).replace(/</g,'\\u003c') %></script>
<script src="/js/battles.js" defer></script>
